---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<LegalPage title="Imprint">
  <h2>Information pursuant to § 5 DDG and § 18 MStV</h2>
  <p>{profile.name}</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>E-mail: <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a></p>

  <h2>Responsible for content</h2>
  <p>{profile.name}</p>

  <h2>Liability for content</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this website was created with care. However, no guarantee can be given for its accuracy,
    completeness or timeliness. As a private person, I am responsible for my own content on these pages under general law.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability for links</h2>
  <p>
    This website contains links to external websites. I have no influence on their content and therefore accept no
    liability for it. The respective provider is always responsible for the content of linked pages. If I become aware
    of any legal violations, I will remove such links immediately.
  </p>

  <h2>Copyright</h2>
  <p>
    Texts and photos on this website are my own unless stated otherwise. Please ask before reusing them.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
